6. Data not distributed here
----------------------------
   Provincial voting-area boundaries, provincial results by voting place or
   voting area, and federal poll-by-poll results are never redistributed in
   this repository. The atlas
   reads them at runtime from files the user downloads, and they remain
   subject to whatever terms Elections BC and Elections Canada attach to them.

   The provincial boundaries the atlas is written for are Elections BC's
   Provincial Electoral District Voting Areas (WHSE_ADMIN_BOUNDARIES.
   EBC_VOTING_AREAS_BS11_POLY_SVW), ordered from the BC Data Catalogue under
   the Elections BC Open Data Licence (https://www.elections.bc.ca/docs/
   EBC-Open-Data-Licence.pdf). Neither those polygons nor anything derived
   from them is included here; tools/clip_geojson.py only cuts down a copy the
   user already holds, on the user's own machine. The synthetic voting-area
   fixtures under tests/ are invented and carry no Elections BC data.
   Elections BC has not endorsed this work and is not responsible for it.

   Statistics Canada's census products -- the 2021 Census Profile, the 2021
   Geographic Attribute File and the dissemination-area and dissemination-block
   boundary files -- are likewise never redistributed. The user downloads them
   under the Statistics Canada Open Licence (https://www.statcan.gc.ca/en/
   reference/licence), cuts them down with tools/filter_census.py and loads the
   results at runtime. Where the atlas or its exports show census figures they
   are adapted from Statistics Canada, Census Profile, 2021 Census of
   Population, and the 2021 Geographic Attribute File; this does not
   constitute an endorsement by Statistics Canada. The synthetic census-shaped
   fixtures under tests/ are invented and carry no Statistics Canada data.
